Pārvieto savu lojalitātes karti uz savu viedtālruni! Jaunā Coffee Inn aplikācija tagad pilnībā aizstās Tavu Coffee Inn kafijas karti.

Tev vēl nav lojalitātes kartes? Iegādājies to, piereģistrē aplikācijā un:
-nopelni atpakaļ 10% no katras iegādātās kafijas;
-norēķinies par kafiju ar savu viedtālruni;
-pārbaudi savu “PayNgo” bilanci konkrētajā brīdī;
-ātri nosaki ceļu līdz tuvākajam Coffee Inn;
-uzzini par aktuālajiem Coffee Inn jaunumiem un citiem pasākumiem pilsētā.

Jautājumi? Ieteikumi? Gaidīsim no Tevis ziņu uz mc@coffee-inn.eu

SIZZAPP is an advanced Real-time Tracking and Security Solution for motorcycles and other motor vehicles that not only saves your vehicle but also collects its data and provides it to you in a simple and user-friendly way WITH NO Monthly or Subscription fee EVER.

SIZZAPP is a simple solution that connects motorcycle to the application through a small monitoring device, which allows you to track not only it’s location, technical condition but also the riding style.

Functionality:
Vehicle’s real-time location (GPS & LTE-M);
24/7 Protection;
Trip history;
All your vehicles control on one map;
Route sharing in GPX and PNG;
Speed Statistics;
Distance today;
Battery level control;
Smart notifications of hits/crashes/towing/device disconnection;
Remote unit configuration;
Navigation to your vehicle;
Group riding with friends;
Geofence settings;
Eco-drive;
Maintenance /events planning;

SIZZAPP solution is suitable for motorcycles, scooters, cars, ATVs, boats, jet skis, snowmobiles and other motor vehicles.

Please note that SIZZAPP application requires the SIZZAPP tracking device to be installed on the vehicle.

